  "context": "# Goal\nTameshi round 38 (L1 TameshiR38, attempt 1). Two claims are FROZEN in\n/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tameshi-shokunin/.ufo/evidence/round-38/contract.json (read it first).\nC1 (calibration, the lane's lowest non-retired axis at 8): the lane's self-assessment records must\nagree with the observed repo state -- the frozen counter\n`python3 .ufo/evidence/round-35/c2/c2-measure.py --lane LANE --rev REV --fleet /home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin`\nmust print total=0 (six classes m1..m6) at the round commit; at the base rev ea8f14aa it prints\ntotal=2 (m3: a tameshi seat file stranded untracked at the fleet root; m6: the SCORECARD standing\nsources-registry row claims 99 rows while corpus/SOURCES.md holds 101).\nC2 (depth): the golden-comparison three-outcome verdict discipline (frontier F4) enters the lane\nwith a behavioural fixture -- `python3 .ufo/evidence/round-38/golden/measure.py --lane LANE --rev REV`\nmust print cases=3/3 mutant_killed=true entry_ok=true C2_R38_PASS=true at the round commit; at the\nbase rev it prints cases=0/3 and exits 1. The tool bytes are frozen by sha256 in the contract; no\ntool edit after the pin.\n\n# Planner and roles\nThe L1 holds the canonical planner seat (the wave validator rejects a `planner` role -- a\nfrozen-topology seat). A bounded planning data-walk rides the scout/connector/reviewer items:\nre-derive the plan from the contract, do not re-plan the round. Roles here: connector, scout,\nexecutor, scribe, reviewer, critic, mutation-tester, sentinel. Do not invent a planner role and do\nnot pass a model -- taxonomy roles route through the operator's global table in\n/home/vgpnk/.omp/agent/config.yml. Never hardcode a model alias.\n\n# Hard write and process bounds\nLane repo: /home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tameshi-shokunin. Every `Report:` trailer is relative to\nthat lane root: write it at /home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tameshi-shokunin/<that path>.\nYou are a leaf: no delegation, no background jobs, no spawns.\nNever mutate the fleet repo, a sibling lane, the lane's jj state, the lane Git index, `.git`,\n`.ufo/state`, or the domain source trees. /home/vgpnk/Projects/shokuknow is READ-ONLY: never\nwrite, commit, fetch or push there and never run a campaign tool inside it (renumber-staged.py,\nmerge-plan.py, quote-lint.py, absent-defect-register.py all write into it). Read their output only.\nNever edit /home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tameshi-shokunin/considerthese/ -- mine it, never edit it.\nScratch for code you write: /tmp/tameshi-r38-<YourSeatName>/ (never inside the lane repo, never\ninside the fleet root). Your only write inside the lane repo is your own report file under\n.ufo/waves/round-38/w1/. Do not run git commit, git add, git push, jj commit or any mutating git/jj\ncommand; read-only git (log, show, diff, status, ls-files, rev-parse) is fine. Do not touch\n/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/.ufo/state/* or the watchdog log, and do not touch any file that\nanother lane's seat wrote.\n\n# Tooling\nOperator tooling authorization: you may install or update a tool that helps this item, but only\nafter reading /home/vgpnk/.omp/agent/RULES.md (official source/channel policy, host update-safety\ngate, installation record: tool, version, channel, reason). Channel order: pacman only after its\nsafety gate, then uv tool, official release binary, cargo/npm. PACMAN TRANSACTIONS ARE PAUSED\nHOST-WIDE (operator ruling 2026-10-20): do not run pacman at all; use uv/npx/official binary in\n~/.local/bin, or report the need in your report. No install is required for any item here.\n\n# Claims and falsification\nDo not widen the frozen predicates. A counter run outside the frozen command, a predicate stated\ndifferently than the contract, or a rule changed after a seat has scored is not the claim's rule.\nName in your report which claim and which part of its predicate you attacked or verified, and\npaste the exact command and output. An unrun check has not passed. If you cannot verify, say so.\nAttack items must name what they attack (the file, the line, the claim sentence). Report adverse\nor inconclusive evidence; never repair it silently and never smooth a disagreement.\n\n# Scope of what this wave may conclude\nEverything you write is evidence for the L1 to integrate; no seat is a judge and no seat's verdict\nis a promotion verdict. The L1 alone writes the lane's production files, the SCORECARD rows, the\nlesson and the report.",
